# The shop checkout is a WORKSPACE: everything the setup scripts create
# next to the shop's own files stays out of git — including the
# framework working copy at solid-node/ (its version is the pilot's
# choice: released tag, main, a fork). Each project under projects/
# is its OWN repository (untracked here).
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
# Vite output for the shop floor browser surface. Generated from
# floor/frontend by scripts/setup (and `npm --prefix floor/frontend run
# build`); content-hashed and minified, so tracking it made every
# frontend merge conflict. The wheel still ships it via package-data.
floor/static/
playwright-report/
test-results/
# No trailing slash: this must also ignore the framework sprint worktree
# link a cross-repository sprint creates at WTs/sprint-NNN/solid-node,
# which is a symlink rather than a directory.
/solid-node
# Independent browser-delivery prototype repositories, each with its own
# Git history (see AGENTS.md, "Browser delivery prototypes").
/browser-engine
/mcp-server
/browser-plugin
# Independent molejo library repository (analytic flexible parts),
# born from the flexible-leaf finding; its own Git history.
/molejo
WTs/
.env
projects/*
!projects/README.md
*.pyc
__pycache__
